    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389040/extras/f745863766180179ec083c2896c8597f.avif?t=1751598638\" /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world\u2019s weirdest factory. You don\u2019t swing swords or cast spells, instead you build tiny heroes out of shapes, and hope for the best as they come up against endless swarms of increasingly brutal enemies. All in a day\u2019s work!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389040/extras/429a6aa911900a58e8a3cda41ca0ace9.poster.avif?t=1751598638\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389040/extras/429a6aa911900a58e8a3cda41ca0ace9.webm?t=1751598638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389040/extras/429a6aa911900a58e8a3cda41ca0ace9.mp4?t=1751598638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389040/extras/cbd415d756e11bf8259348c631ac8f45.avif?t=1751598638\" /></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop shapes onto conveyor belts to craft self-operation heroes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want a soldier? Try a circle and a triangle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want a tank? Try circle and square.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroes fight on their own, you\u2019re just there to make the decisions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389040/extras/a2f755523ac4637058da945ad037f3e1.avif?t=1751598638\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies get weirder, stronger and ruder as you progress </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your Portal from swarming pests and brute squads </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn magical artifacts and upgrade your factory like there's no tomorrow.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389040/extras/9179241185874b2c4309b589ce100cdd.poster.avif?t=1751598638\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389040/extras/9179241185874b2c4309b589ce100cdd.webm?t=1751598638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389040/extras/9179241185874b2c4309b589ce100cdd.mp4?t=1751598638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389040/extras/ee75612b76ea8e50413b8cef9c2cd9a2.avif?t=1751598638\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different playable characters - \u2018Masters\u2019 - have different hero types and build strategies </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different characters to unlock their Arcane Knowledge (permanent upgrades) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a playstyle that suits you best </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389040/extras/ce7ab3bf437060ea18bf204c1cf775e6.avif?t=1751598638\" /></span>You can\u2019t control your troops, but you can outsmart the darkness waiting to gobble up your kingdom, one conveyor belt at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world\u2019s weirdest factory. You don\u2019t swing swords or cast spells, instead you build tiny heroes out of shapes, and hope for the best as they come up against endless swarms of increasingly brutal enemies. All in a day\u2019s work!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389040/extras/429a6aa911900a58e8a3cda41ca0ace9.poster.avif?t=1751598638\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389040/extras/429a6aa911900a58e8a3cda41ca0ace9.webm?t=1751598638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389040/extras/429a6aa911900a58e8a3cda41ca0ace9.mp4?t=1751598638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389040/extras/cbd415d756e11bf8259348c631ac8f45.avif?t=1751598638\" /></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop shapes onto conveyor belts to craft self-operation heroes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want a soldier? Try a circle and a triangle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want a tank? Try circle and square.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroes fight on their own, you\u2019re just there to make the decisions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389040/extras/a2f755523ac4637058da945ad037f3e1.avif?t=1751598638\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies get weirder, stronger and ruder as you progress </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your Portal from swarming pests and brute squads </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn magical artifacts and upgrade your factory like there's no tomorrow.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389040/extras/9179241185874b2c4309b589ce100cdd.poster.avif?t=1751598638\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389040/extras/9179241185874b2c4309b589ce100cdd.webm?t=1751598638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389040/extras/9179241185874b2c4309b589ce100cdd.mp4?t=1751598638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389040/extras/ee75612b76ea8e50413b8cef9c2cd9a2.avif?t=1751598638\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different playable characters - \u2018Masters\u2019 - have different hero types and build strategies </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different characters to unlock their Arcane Knowledge (permanent upgrades) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a playstyle that suits you best </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389040/extras/ce7ab3bf437060ea18bf204c1cf775e6.avif?t=1751598638\" /></span>You can\u2019t control your troops, but you can outsmart the darkness waiting to gobble up your kingdom, one conveyor belt at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "In ShapeHero Factory, you\u2019re the engineer of an ever-evolving paint-fuelled factory that spits out magical, shape-based warriors. Send them into battle - to death or glory - then build an even better factory on your next run.",
